      "en": "Beat your breasts for the pleasant fields, for the fruitful vine.",
      "ko": "좋은 밭을 위하며 열매 많은 포도나무를 위하여 가슴을 치게 될 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f860c050b24884280cf9ce6b8721fcc7daf6306e5d7295c5265aab29ebad1e86",
      "translation_text_hash": "6666233d8145a8b2a1ab5e96deb9df121fcae67d48808fdeb860c4da58f48ee4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
